<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="pMBaq" id="pMBaq"><span data-lake-id="u3dd7a0c3" id="u3dd7a0c3">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uac419262" id="uac419262"><span data-lake-id="u5321ee0c" id="u5321ee0c">例化在MissQueue中，一次只做一条cacheline的 clean flush inval，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8c092fc6" id="u8c092fc6">注意不做zero。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue6a7fe46" id="ue6a7fe46"><span data-lake-id="ucd1ed24e" id="ucd1ed24e">clean:将本条cacheline中脏的部分写回到下级缓存中，但该条cacheline依旧在缓存中有效。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2c1095d7" id="u2c1095d7"><span data-lake-id="u98bfc0b7" id="u98bfc0b7">flush:先将本条cacheline中脏的部分写回到下级缓存中，并且令该条cacheline无效。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u56c61b71" id="u56c61b71"><span data-lake-id="uf6574827" id="uf6574827">inval:直接将该条cacheline无效，不写回脏数据。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u22b872e0" id="u22b872e0"><span data-lake-id="uf196585f" id="uf196585f">zero:讲该cacheline的所有字节都写为0。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua864c384" id="ua864c384"><strong><span data-lake-id="u44e2bc2b" id="u44e2bc2b">zero会被StoreQueue当成是一条全写0的store处理。</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="JH526" id="JH526"><span data-lake-id="u958b7aa5" id="u958b7aa5">接口描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0465068b" id="u0465068b"><span data-lake-id="u0d1f751b" id="u0d1f751b">方向是从CMOUnit角度来看，通过valid/ready来握手。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub50e9aff" id="ub50e9aff"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3970763a" id="u3970763a">CMOUnitIO</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id="g9o7R" id="g9o7R" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 561px"><colgroup><col width="187"><col width="187"><col width="187"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u0ca1234a" id="u0ca1234a"><td data-lake-id="ue49dd913" id="ue49dd913"><p data-lake-id="u9b5e9caa" id="u9b5e9caa"><span data-lake-id="u2709142f" id="u2709142f">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufa7c1878" id="ufa7c1878"><p data-lake-id="u971473ea" id="u971473ea"><span data-lake-id="ue376fb41" id="ue376fb41">方向</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf69218ee" id="uf69218ee"><p data-lake-id="u29583ae0" id="u29583ae0"><span data-lake-id="u1a16e70e" id="u1a16e70e">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u35870a30" id="u35870a30"><td data-lake-id="u836ccb68" id="u836ccb68"><p data-lake-id="u5bf6db97" id="u5bf6db97"><span data-lake-id="u8877aac9" id="u8877aac9">CMOReq</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u6ba61326" id="u6ba61326"><p data-lake-id="uff7c8750" id="uff7c8750"><span data-lake-id="ude347aa5" id="ude347aa5">in</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u962055ce" id="u962055ce"><p data-lake-id="u23ef01a6" id="u23ef01a6"><span data-lake-id="u6e25f87b" id="u6e25f87b">CMO操作请求</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ubb3bdeac" id="ubb3bdeac"><td data-lake-id="u7b568921" id="u7b568921"><p data-lake-id="u93a50adb" id="u93a50adb"><span data-lake-id="ue93df54c" id="ue93df54c">CMOResp</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ufbc28586" id="ufbc28586"><p data-lake-id="ud98a2cb1" id="ud98a2cb1"><span data-lake-id="u1b40c483" id="u1b40c483">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ua718800f" id="ua718800f"><p data-lake-id="u3bae0bce" id="u3bae0bce"><span data-lake-id="u1af72ff9" id="u1af72ff9">收到CmopCMO才拉高</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u3db778da" id="u3db778da"><td data-lake-id="u142a801a" id="u142a801a"><p data-lake-id="ud0eef8a5" id="ud0eef8a5"><span data-lake-id="u765f8a68" id="u765f8a68">wfi.req wfi.safe</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u68a85d1c" id="u68a85d1c"><p data-lake-id="u8a820444" id="u8a820444"><span data-lake-id="ufd233337" id="ufd233337">in out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u679a1329" id="u679a1329"><p data-lake-id="ub08512ff" id="ub08512ff"><span data-lake-id="u183782f1" id="u183782f1">休眠</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u3f18e027" id="u3f18e027"><td data-lake-id="u808b143e" id="u808b143e"><p data-lake-id="u356a20aa" id="u356a20aa"><span data-lake-id="u1c8122b0" id="u1c8122b0">TXREQ</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u64504d24" id="u64504d24"><p data-lake-id="u08dec4c3" id="u08dec4c3"><span data-lake-id="u4ec49b3c" id="u4ec49b3c">out</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4742aa36" id="u4742aa36"><p data-lake-id="uf60b5438" id="uf60b5438"><span data-lake-id="uf8ba3443" id="uf8ba3443">发请求给L2</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u16073c8a" id="u16073c8a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubc117d19" id="ubc117d19">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="u57982421" id="u57982421"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue584eadd" id="ue584eadd">CMOReq </span></strong></p><table data-lake-id="CmwT4" id="CmwT4" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 726px"><colgroup><col width="121"><col width="605"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u0bec6d21" id="u0bec6d21"><td data-lake-id="ufd5271be" id="ufd5271be"><p data-lake-id="u58383be2" id="u58383be2"><span data-lake-id="u63a892a9" id="u63a892a9">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u2f950566" id="u2f950566"><p data-lake-id="u1a95790a" id="u1a95790a"><span data-lake-id="u192d0927" id="u192d0927">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uc945cba6" id="uc945cba6"><td data-lake-id="u50081669" id="u50081669"><p data-lake-id="u91d35b8b" id="u91d35b8b"><span data-lake-id="u8775b6d1" id="u8775b6d1">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u8bb4ed00" id="u8bb4ed00"><p data-lake-id="u012e620b" id="u012e620b"><span data-lake-id="u6f7f7af2" id="u6f7f7af2">StoreQueue发的编号，响应返回的时候通过这个id,SQ能知道是什么CMO事务</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ud95f0190" id="ud95f0190"><td data-lake-id="u9f46b7ac" id="u9f46b7ac"><p data-lake-id="u35e93d29" id="u35e93d29"><span data-lake-id="u1199348b" id="u1199348b">opcode</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1bb84dae" id="u1bb84dae"><p data-lake-id="u7aa9f7e9" id="u7aa9f7e9"><span data-lake-id="u4494caa5" id="u4494caa5">用于区分clean flush inval的哪种</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u434363b9" id="u434363b9"><td data-lake-id="u9fad9367" id="u9fad9367"><p data-lake-id="u0026f0c1" id="u0026f0c1"><span data-lake-id="u40b57620" id="u40b57620">paddr</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u018a6733" id="u018a6733"><p data-lake-id="ubc45ce8e" id="ubc45ce8e"><span data-lake-id="ub298c583" id="ub298c583">物理地址，代表操作的缓存行</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2af21e54" id="u2af21e54"><td data-lake-id="u154515e3" id="u154515e3"><p data-lake-id="u4bee80c6" id="u4bee80c6"><span data-lake-id="ubcf42125" id="ubcf42125">alias</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u13e83dce" id="u13e83dce"><p data-lake-id="ucc0c6773" id="ucc0c6773"><span data-lake-id="ubce25558" id="ubce25558">索引set的高位虚地址</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u659f26cf" id="u659f26cf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a4c0b44" id="u9a4c0b44">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="uc6cdd203" id="uc6cdd203"><strong><span data-lake-id="u562fa4a0" id="u562fa4a0">CMOResp</span></strong></p><table data-lake-id="g7M0J" id="g7M0J" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 724px"><colgroup><col width="124"><col width="600"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="ue5f98a1a" id="ue5f98a1a"><td data-lake-id="u0d05ea5a" id="u0d05ea5a"><p data-lake-id="uf59a4041" id="uf59a4041"><span data-lake-id="u0d4c35e8" id="u0d4c35e8">字段</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5fa65677" id="u5fa65677"><p data-lake-id="u7df0188b" id="u7df0188b"><span data-lake-id="u6b4eb650" id="u6b4eb650">作用</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u7f6694d3" id="u7f6694d3"><td data-lake-id="u6c4fbd7b" id="u6c4fbd7b"><p data-lake-id="u2b97a143" id="u2b97a143"><span data-lake-id="ufb29e5a6" id="ufb29e5a6">id</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u04a2f337" id="u04a2f337"><p data-lake-id="u9bfcf177" id="u9bfcf177"><span data-lake-id="u8a895c6a" id="u8a895c6a">对应请求的id</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="uac251b7c" id="uac251b7c"><td data-lake-id="u93f2a166" id="u93f2a166"><p data-lake-id="ub55a1ce5" id="ub55a1ce5"><span data-lake-id="ubba14fdc" id="ubba14fdc">done</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u35ba4287" id="u35ba4287"><p data-lake-id="u6cad8cb5" id="u6cad8cb5"><span data-lake-id="u35e950cf" id="u35e950cf">代表状态机状态变成空闲了，等价为CMO操作做完。</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u9cb50129" id="u9cb50129"><td data-lake-id="u6120e7a2" id="u6120e7a2"><p data-lake-id="u75cca42e" id="u75cca42e"><span data-lake-id="u17f2749f" id="u17f2749f">error</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u25b9ff04" id="u25b9ff04"><p data-lake-id="u6c681326" id="u6c681326"><span data-lake-id="u8326252a" id="u8326252a">L2的CompCMO.respErr非0，表示是否响应错误。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u5e52edcf" id="u5e52edcf"><span data-lake-id="u463c0b0c" id="u463c0b0c">StoreQueue发出请求后，就必须每个时钟周期都准备好接收响应，CMO没有replay机制。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0be6f971" id="u0be6f971"><strong><span data-lake-id="u88883678" id="u88883678">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5dd61d16" id="u5dd61d16"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9e7a166" id="uf9e7a166">TXREQ</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ub986d422" id="ub986d422"><span data-lake-id="u9a75d50f" id="u9a75d50f">可见DCache -&gt; L2接口，注意CMO发txnID只发16。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Sluhm" id="Sluhm"><span data-lake-id="u2e346289" id="u2e346289">事务描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u55ff3ea1" id="u55ff3ea1"><span data-lake-id="u1d7fbfa1" id="u1d7fbfa1">CMO事务流程</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue44c5a06" id="ue44c5a06"><span data-lake-id="ub32a00f1" id="ub32a00f1">CMO只有在StoreBuffer排空的时候才能发出。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uae64172a" id="uae64172a"><span data-lake-id="ud33a6427" id="ud33a6427">不发进Mainpipe，直接发到AMOUnit中，通过CMOreq的opcode可以得出是clean，flush，inval中的哪个。发TXREQ给L2Cache，L2根据收到的CMO看目录L1是否有这个缓存行，转化为对应的snoop操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue99522c9" id="ue99522c9"><span data-lake-id="uc97f6068" id="uc97f6068">如果是clean的话就要求DCache写回该行脏数据，并且置为Clean（UD-&gt;UC, UC-&gt;UC, SC-&gt;SC，如果是I的话根本就不发snoop）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5b341978" id="u5b341978"><span data-lake-id="u9fd8bd37" id="u9fd8bd37">如果是flush的话就要求DCache写回该行脏数据，并且置为I。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u769f419b" id="u769f419b"><span data-lake-id="ucf43ef20" id="ucf43ef20">如果是inval的话直接要求DCache状态置为I。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0e3a40fc" id="u0e3a40fc"><span data-lake-id="ub2eb93dc" id="ub2eb93dc">zero的话会被提前处理为store 全0操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u061e6631" id="u061e6631"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf864e487" id="uf864e487"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="fd8U9" id="fd8U9"><span data-lake-id="u90f66f9e" id="u90f66f9e">状态机行为</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua6f35584" id="ua6f35584"><span data-lake-id="u11edb436" id="u11edb436">一共有4个状态，分别为  </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11b31d13" id="u11b31d13">s_idle，s_sreq，s_wresp，s_lsq_resp</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2f48c6c5" id="u2f48c6c5">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2acacb9e" id="u2acacb9e"><br></p><table data-lake-id="mFeB6" id="mFeB6" class="lake-table" style="width: 562px"><colgroup><col width="97"><col width="198"><col width="267"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u84866e94" id="u84866e94"><td data-lake-id="u651d0276" id="u651d0276"><p data-lake-id="u6f0a2f50" id="u6f0a2f50"><span data-lake-id="u10e8443e" id="u10e8443e">状态</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uf201e2f7" id="uf201e2f7"><p data-lake-id="u4fb57035" id="u4fb57035"><span data-lake-id="uc7d312cc" id="uc7d312cc">何时转变</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ubc2cf3e6" id="ubc2cf3e6"><p data-lake-id="u2239f513" id="u2239f513"><span data-lake-id="u8de093d3" id="u8de093d3">含义</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua441054c" id="ua441054c"><td data-lake-id="uc0cc4d90" id="uc0cc4d90"><p data-lake-id="u5f44b078" id="u5f44b078"><code data-lake-id="u509b2f57" id="u509b2f57"><span data-lake-id="ub6ba5aab" id="ub6ba5aab">s_idle</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u1dcab5d3" id="u1dcab5d3"><p data-lake-id="u66ff0e05" id="u66ff0e05"><code data-lake-id="u7d78732b" id="u7d78732b"><span data-lake-id="ud03fd361" id="ud03fd361">cmoReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u79f0c59d" id="u79f0c59d"> 被收下，进入 </span><code data-lake-id="u84dc5c57" id="u84dc5c57"><span data-lake-id="u8edeaf0f" id="u8edeaf0f">s_sreq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u4cc8b448" id="u4cc8b448">。同时锁存 id、opcode、paddr、alias，</span><code data-lake-id="ua55f0a7d" id="ua55f0a7d"><span data-lake-id="uda6967eb" id="uda6967eb">error</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5b6a34b9" id="u5b6a34b9"> 清 0</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u171ef4d8" id="u171ef4d8"><p data-lake-id="uf5e4ae68" id="uf5e4ae68"><span data-lake-id="u7f895a04" id="u7f895a04">空闲。</span><code data-lake-id="uef3cbca7" id="uef3cbca7"><span data-lake-id="u2ad1140e" id="u2ad1140e">cmoReq.ready=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="u0e4b0534" id="u0e4b0534">，</span><code data-lake-id="ua98b3c71" id="ua98b3c71"><span data-lake-id="uf6b513da" id="uf6b513da">wfi.safe=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="ucdb42220" id="ucdb42220">。没有正在做的 CMO</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u823435c9" id="u823435c9"><td data-lake-id="ucf41986d" id="ucf41986d"><p data-lake-id="u71d6f8f5" id="u71d6f8f5"><code data-lake-id="ufddddda7" id="ufddddda7"><span data-lake-id="u5f533013" id="u5f533013">s_sreq</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3fc1f909" id="u3fc1f909"><p data-lake-id="u1a37593e" id="u1a37593e"><span data-lake-id="u463d4046" id="u463d4046">同地址没有 MissEntry、</span><code data-lake-id="u86a2500e" id="u86a2500e"><span data-lake-id="u67af06e4" id="u67af06e4">wbBlock=0</span></code><span data-lake-id="u36c90a31" id="u36c90a31">，并且 L2 收下 </span><code data-lake-id="u356d553a" id="u356d553a"><span data-lake-id="u7d129c63" id="u7d129c63">txnId=16</span></code><span data-lake-id="u88863555" id="u88863555"> 的 TXREQ，进入 </span><code data-lake-id="u0c0e05fb" id="u0c0e05fb"><span data-lake-id="u7826b341" id="u7826b341">s_wresp</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u31f50d9c" id="u31f50d9c"><p data-lake-id="ufaf2c326" id="ufaf2c326"><span data-lake-id="u148baaea" id="u148baaea">请求已经收下，准备发给 L2。障碍还在，或者这一拍 miss 优先，TXREQ 保持不动</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u2ddefc86" id="u2ddefc86"><td data-lake-id="uf75f8081" id="uf75f8081"><p data-lake-id="udac382f2" id="udac382f2"><code data-lake-id="u16638fab" id="u16638fab"><span data-lake-id="u2954271e" id="u2954271e">s_wresp</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u30f6c02f" id="u30f6c02f"><p data-lake-id="u1a130c3f" id="u1a130c3f"><span data-lake-id="u72bd5070" id="u72bd5070">RXRSP 是 </span><code data-lake-id="ub8a8dcef" id="ub8a8dcef"><span data-lake-id="u8c8ec905" id="u8c8ec905">txnId=16</span></code><span data-lake-id="u80a22ecb" id="u80a22ecb"> 的 </span><code data-lake-id="u8f64b182" id="u8f64b182"><span data-lake-id="ue4598cb4" id="ue4598cb4">CompCMO</span></code><span data-lake-id="u6e274c3b" id="u6e274c3b">，进入 </span><code data-lake-id="u124fa602" id="u124fa602"><span data-lake-id="u7fda2fb9" id="u7fda2fb9">s_lsq_resp</span></code><span data-lake-id="u476b1ba3" id="u476b1ba3">。</span><code data-lake-id="ue55f4c12" id="ue55f4c12"><span data-lake-id="u60645905" id="u60645905">respErr</span></code><span data-lake-id="u8d6cc1cf" id="u8d6cc1cf"> 非 0 时把 </span><code data-lake-id="uab16da8c" id="uab16da8c"><span data-lake-id="u99a2f278" id="u99a2f278">error</span></code><span data-lake-id="u37dcba6e" id="u37dcba6e"> 置 1</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7ba45817" id="u7ba45817"><p data-lake-id="uf3ad0c67" id="uf3ad0c67"><span data-lake-id="u835d96f6" id="u835d96f6">TXREQ 已经发出，只等 L2 完成。不等 Snoop，也不等 WritebackQueue</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u4f8dc459" id="u4f8dc459"><td data-lake-id="u7c1003f9" id="u7c1003f9"><p data-lake-id="u0cee6f3d" id="u0cee6f3d"><code data-lake-id="u8c6906a2" id="u8c6906a2"><span data-lake-id="u12c60c40" id="u12c60c40">s_lsq_resp</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u94b24713" id="u94b24713"><p data-lake-id="ua4cc8d16" id="ua4cc8d16"><code data-lake-id="ub40445a5" id="ub40445a5"><span data-lake-id="u4796d1e3" id="u4796d1e3">cmoResp</span></code><span data-lake-id="u2372c19d" id="u2372c19d"> 被 StoreQueue 收下，回到 </span><code data-lake-id="u61227296" id="u61227296"><span data-lake-id="u5e219730" id="u5e219730">s_idle</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u145e6e35" id="u145e6e35"><p data-lake-id="u40f4f661" id="u40f4f661"><span data-lake-id="u79617a4e" id="u79617a4e">把 </span><code data-lake-id="u22d2a078" id="u22d2a078"><span data-lake-id="u60716e90" id="u60716e90">id</span></code><span data-lake-id="u1fad4832" id="u1fad4832">、</span><code data-lake-id="uf77672a1" id="uf77672a1"><span data-lake-id="uf0973b0e" id="uf0973b0e">done=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="u0913cdd6" id="u0913cdd6">、</span><code data-lake-id="uabd18012" id="uabd18012"><span data-lake-id="u5cf2cc58" id="u5cf2cc58">error</span></code><span data-lake-id="u5159465c" id="u5159465c"> 交回 StoreQueue。这条 CMO 到此结束</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="ua297a3c8" id="ua297a3c8"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u25327c40" id="u25327c40"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793372346071-072e3202-22b7-40f7-ab35-bab6a2809d4c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue9afa01d-af20-4a0b-9528-fcb232c88d2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ucd2338aa-50f0-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A558.9333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A341%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A122817%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1048%2C%22originHeight%22%3A640%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5625%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22CMOREQ%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8B%2C%E9%94%81%E5%AD%98ID%2C%20OPCODE%2CPADDR%2C%20ALIAS%20S%20IDLE%20SSREG%20%E5%8F%91TXREQ%20%E8%A2%ABL2%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8B%20CMORESP%E8%A2%AB%20STOREQUEUE%20%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8B%2C%E5%9B%9E%E5%88%B0%20%E7%A9%BA%E9%97%B2%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%20S_LSQ_RESP%20S_WRESP%20%E5%8F%91RXRSP%E8%A2%ABPROBEQUE%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A392%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A248%2C%22height%22%3A23%2C%22text%22%3A%22CMOREQ%E8%A2%AB%E6%94%B6%E4%B8%8B%2C%E9%94%81%E5%AD%98ID%2C%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A413%2C%22y%22%3A49%2C%22width%22%3A219%2C%22height%22%3A22%2C%22text%22%3A%22OPCODE%2CPADDR%2C%20ALIAS%22%7D%2C%7B%22x%22%3A259%2C%2